{
  "subject": "Water quality of the river Yamuna",
  "transcription": "Parsed once, offline, from the CPCB PDF named below, then COMMITTED. scripts/fetch-yamuna.mjs re-downloads that PDF and checks its SHA-256 against the value recorded here. It never rewrites this table: CPCB publishes annually, so a change to the document is a human event, not a refresh.",
